<h2>Campaign setup</h2>
<p>The account ran Google Search campaigns, including remarketing to past website visitors on Search. The primary conversion for this comparison was a tour booking.</p>
<h2>What the result shows</h2>
<p>Tours increased while cost per tour fell. A tour is an early step in the leasing process. Linking tour and application records to the property management system can show how many became signed leases.</p>
